      "title": "GTP: Retrieve gtp_conv_info inside GTP' data transfer resp",
      "message": "GTP: Retrieve gtp_conv_info inside GTP' data transfer resp\n\nargs is only non-null when Session Tracking is on, which is not\nby default.\n\nRetrieve (creating if necessary) the gtp conversation info inside\nthe GTP' Data Transfer Response instead of passing it in args.\n\nMake a note about how the source IP address of the response does not\nhave to be the destination IP of the address, though the other 3\nports and addresses do have to match. (See 3GPP 29.060 10.1 UDP/IP;\nI think we do have some sample captures somewhere that show this.)\n\nFix #20222\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-11-15T07:37:30.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
